Third-party software redistributed in the JAVV images
------------------------------------------------------

The scanner images (javv-scanner-trivy, javv-scanner-grype) contain a scanner binary copied
unmodified from the scanner's official image. Its license, and its NOTICE where it has one, are
included in the image under /licenses/<scanner>/ and in this repository under
scanner/licenses/<scanner>/.

